WEBVTT

00:42:30.413 --> 00:42:36.704
And some also just like the logistics of
of giving myself real time to write.

00:42:36.704 --> 00:42:40.996
So all through my 20s, I was a waitress,
I was a youth advocate.

00:42:40.996 --> 00:42:44.746
I was a vegetable picker in an organic
farm. I like I was an EMT.

00:42:44.746 --> 00:42:48.204
I did all kinds of things. But what
I was really doing was writing.

00:42:48.204 --> 00:42:52.704
That was my real work. And it was I had
this big student loan to pay off.

00:42:52.704 --> 00:42:56.038
It was exhausting always to be
just living hand-to-mouth

00:42:56.329 --> 00:42:58.913
and struggling financially
while trying to write.

00:42:58.913 --> 00:43:01.204
And and I sort of always thought like.